;    1: TDecorate(count=97, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=つばき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=にえ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あお, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=975, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=890, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I rewrote the ancient documents among the storehouse's books into a form that even people of the present day could readily understand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">'From this point on, important matters are written down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I have translated them into the language of today, so that our descendants may read them even a little more easily. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Please, put this to good use. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I do not have long now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Shiyo 735, the Grand Witch, Kikyo Niimura'</STYLE><PG>
What it records is that back in Shiyo 482, the young Grand Witch, <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="つばき">Tsubaki</STYLE> Niimura, sacrificed herself to drive off Shigatsu Youka.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The people of that time seem to have believed they drove it off, but judging by how things stand, Shigatsu Youka still exists.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What I must do from here:
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Administer falsificaso to the residents
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Seal the Verde mummy
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, the residents will be freed from the curse of Droga―
{PAUSE ""}
of Shigatsu Youka.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
That afternoon, I administered falsificaso to everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That should have spared them from the infection.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The next day, I went to the underground storeroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thanks to the seal stone underground, no one would lay a hand on the Verde mummy either, at least for the time being.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had also considered burning the Verde mummy, or handing it to <STYLE ID="3">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> as a research sample.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I judged that to be dangerous.<PG>
Because Verde―
{PAUSE ""}
Tomi was a third-generation girl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was because that thing was there that those infected with Droga turned into cherry trees and became <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="にえ">sacrifices</STYLE> for Shigatsu Youka's reproduction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the Verde mummy were ever to disappear―
{PAUSE ""}
Shigatsu Youka would make a new mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, I had thought that it might create new victims.<PG>
Making a new mummy is, in a sense, a risky act for Shigatsu Youka as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A custom of worshipping a new mummy is not something that can be created so easily, and should the corpses increase, it would only <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="あお">stir up</STYLE> distrust among the residents.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would rather not do it, if it can help it.<PG>
But now that it had lost so many of its fruiting bodies and no infected humans remained, there was no telling what Shigatsu Youka might do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was why I decided to seal the mummy away somewhere the spores could not reach: deep inside the underground storeroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This way, it would be hard for Shigatsu Youka to pinpoint where the mummy was.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下扉あく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And at that spot, claiming there had been a cave-in, I had a door of iron bars put in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had only a handful of people in the settlement do the work, and kept it strictly secret from everyone else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, no one could go any further unless someone of the Niimura family allowed it.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鉄格子開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------